-- Exact net flash-liquidation profit in uUSDC (0-bps Morpho flash loan):
--Given debtRepaidU6, bonusBps (e.g. 500 = 5%), and dexSlippageBps (e.g. 15 = 0.15%):
bfm-liq-net-u6 : Word → Word → Word → Word
bfm-liq-net-u6 debtU6 bonusBps dexCostBps =
  if eth-le bonusBps dexCostBps then #0
  else %wdiv (%wmul debtU6 (%wsub bonusBps dexCostBps)) #10000
